    <version>2.30.0</version>
    <time>1793484525</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- updated to 2.30.0 (2.03)
   see /usr/share/doc/packages/perl-File-Unpack2/Changes
  2.03	kraih Thu Oct 22 17:30:00 CEST 2026
    - Fixed the cached cpio command being returned as an array reference on
      every lookup after the first, which broke unpacking cpio archives when an
      rpm had been unpacked before them in the same run.

- updated to 2.20.0 (2.02)
   see /usr/share/doc/packages/perl-File-Unpack2/Changes
  2.02	kraih Mon Jul 28 14:00:00 CEST 2026
    - Clean release tarball.

- updated to 2.10.0 (2.01)
   see /usr/share/doc/packages/perl-File-Unpack2/Changes
  2.01	kraih Mon Jul 27 15:48:00 CEST 2026
    - Require BSD::Resource and Filesys::Statvfs again, so the maxfilesize and
      free-space safeguards are always enforced (they were silently disabled when
      the modules were only recommended and thus absent from build environments).
    - Skip the PDF tests when pdftotext (poppler-tools) is not installed, so the
      test suite passes in minimal build environments.
  2.0	kraih Thu Jul 23 13:50:00 CEST 2026
    - Big module cleanup to make packaging for Linux distributions easier.
    - Removed bundled mime helper scripts.
  1.5	kraih Tue Jul 22 14:30:00 CEST 2026
    - Fixed non-portable tests failing.
  1.4	kraih Tue Jul 22 14:00:00 CEST 2026
    - Improved service restart handling.
  1.3	kraih Tue Jul 16 14:00:00 CEST 2026
    - Improved handling of malicious archives.
  1.2	kraih Tue May 22 14:00:00 CEST 2026</comment>
    <requestid>1393995</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
